scripts/screenshots/.pixi/
scripts/screenshots/pixi.lock

# Working artefacts: review findings and staging plans. These live at the repo root
# for clickable editor links, which is exactly how an unscoped `git add -A` keeps
# catching them. A review file in particular must never ship — it is a curated
# file-and-line index of this codebase's weak points, and it stays one in the history
# even after every finding is fixed.
CODE_REVIEW.md
PRE_MERGE_PLAN.md
BACKUP_REFACTOR_STATUS.md
